The '''Hanging Court''' is a [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} connected to the {{Zone|Royal Palace}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Hanging Court''' connects the {{Zone|Royal Palace}} to the {{Zone|Aristocrat Passage}} and the {{Zone|Great Ice Wall}}. It features a {{NPCSprite|Ticket Master}}, as well as {{NPCSprite|Dulin}}, who grants access to the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}.

